 	  information about the SoC to the userspace including the
 	  manufacturer name, marketing name and soc name.
 
+config INNIOASIS_Y1_IDLE
+	bool "Innioasis Y1 (MT6572) core parking"
+	depends on ARCH_MEDIATEK && HOTPLUG_CPU && CPU_FREQ && INPUT && NO_HZ_COMMON
+	help
+	  The Y2's idle coordinator with Y1 inputs: CPU1 goes offline after a
+	  sustained quiet window while the screen is dark and no audio stream
+	  runs, and comes back on input, a lit screen, an audio start or load.
+
+config INNIOASIS_Y1_DEEP_IDLE
+	bool "Innioasis Y1 (MT6572) deep idle"
+	depends on INNIOASIS_Y1_IDLE && MTK_PMIC_WRAP && MFD_MT6397 && CPU_IDLE
+	select ARM_CPU_SUSPEND
+	help
+	  Stock's PMIC wrapper DVFS slot table and deep idle on CPU0
+	  (docs/planning/Y1-POWER-PLAN.md section 17): a cpuidle driver whose
+	  deep states run stock's SPM firmware, with CPU0 powered (D6c) or
+	  powered down and resumed through cpu_suspend (D6d). D6d is on
+	  at boot; D6c starts disabled and is enabled through sysfs.
+
